ss=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"308.05827586206897\" cy=\"231.3793103448276\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 79%&amp;#10;It rained 46% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 71 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"338.607323943662\" cy=\"212.81690140845072\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 90%&amp;#10;It rained 59% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 64 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"377.595625\" cy=\"165.875\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 100%&amp;#10;It rained 75% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"410.23\" cy=\"109.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(33%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In George Town the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.12) and least in\n<b>spring</b> (-0.44).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>141</td><td class='num'>20%</td><td class='num'>-0.438</td><td class='num'>26.9%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>171</td><td class='num'>39%</td><td class='num'>-0.204</td><td class='num'>23.4%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>169</td><td class='num'>24%</td><td class='num'>-0.053</td><td class='num'>19.2%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>171</td><td class='num'>49%</td><td class='num'>0.119</td><td class='num'>14.6%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":19.2866,"lon":-81.37436,"n":652,"n_cities":216,"name":"George Town","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.1,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.0373015873015873,"n":63,"obs":0.06349206349206349,"sig":false},{"hi":0.23,"lo":0.1,"mean":0.16552238805970146,"n":67,"obs":0.04477611940298507,"sig":true},{"hi":0.3430000000000004,"lo":0.23,"mean":0.28272727272727266,"n":66,"obs":0.22727272727272727,"sig":false},{"hi":0.45,"lo":0.3430000000000004,"mean":0.3966666666666667,"n":63,"obs":0.20634920634920634,"sig":true},{"hi":0.55,"lo":0.45,"mean":0.4934920634920635,"n":63,"obs":0.23809523809523808,"sig":true},{"hi":0.6620000000000016,"lo":0.55,"mean":0.6015942028985509,"n":69,"obs":0.30434782608695654,"sig":true},{"hi":0.75,"lo":0.6620000000000016,"mean":0.7063793103448276,"n":58,"obs":0.41379310344827586,"sig":true},{"hi":0.86,"lo":0.75,"mean":0.7926760563380282,"n":71,"obs":0.4647887323943662,"sig":true},{"hi":0.97,"lo":0.86,"mean":0.9028125,"n":64,"obs":0.59375,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.97,"mean":0.995,"n":68,"obs":0.75,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":1.7,"provisional":false,"rank":196,"rank_hi":203.0,"rank_lo":181.975,"reliability":0.05598794597576806,"resolution":0.04647519959631649,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"george-town","station":"","timezone":"America/Cayman"}